  "chitchat": [
    "Rue builds three drinks at once without looking at any of them, watching the floor instead.",
    "\"Rule of the house: you can outrun the bass, you can't outrun the tab.\"",
    "She racks a row of glasses under the ice-light and they come up glowing."
  ],
  "description": "Rue works the ice-ribbon bar like a control desk, six things going at once and none of them spilling. Backlit from below, she's all silhouette and quick hands, a comms bud in one ear feeding her the night — who's flush, who's cut off, who's about to be a problem. She'll make you anything on the board and read exactly how your night is going from what you order.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "\"Go dance it off.\" She's already reading the next hand at the rail."
    },
    "menu": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Set me up.",
          "next": "__shop__"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back.",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Signature's the Voltage. Looks like the drop, hits like it too. Neon martini if you want to look like you know what you're doing. Plasma shot if you've given up on that. Or a static fizz and you might actually remember tonight.\" She shrugs. \"Your funeral, your money.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What's good?",
          "next": "menu"
        },
        {
          "label": "Pour me something.",
          "next": "__shop__"
        },
        {
          "label": "How do I get upstairs?",
          "next": "vip"
        },
        {
          "label": "Nothing yet.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Hey.\" Rue doesn't stop moving. \"You want the board, or you want me to just look at you and decide?\" A glass lands in front of you, empty, an invitation. \"Talk fast, it's loud in here.\""
    },
    "vip": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Pour me something, then.",
          "next": "__shop__"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back.",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Upstairs?\" She tips her head at the rope. \"That's Bishop's call, not mine. See the man on the door about a band. Once you've got one, the stair knows you, and up there they pour things I'm not allowed to say out loud down here.\""
    }
  },
